        "original_id": "84a760a6-d3c0-570d-9bd9-119a4d88ac4d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2016 Blancpain GT Series Sprint Cup, FIA GT1 World Championship\n- Organizations: SRO Group, Fédération Internationale de l'Automobile (FIA)\n- Topics: sports car racing, grand tourer car racing series\n\nFacts:\n- The FIA GT1 World Championship was a world championship sports car racing series developed by the SRO Group and regulated by the Fédération Internationale de l'Automobile (FIA) from 2010 to 2012.\n- The 2016 Blancpain GT Series Sprint Cup was the fourth season after the demise of the SRO Group's FIA GT1 World Championship.\n- The 2016 Blancpain GT Series Sprint Cup was the third season to use the designation Blancpain Sprint Series or Blancpain GT Series Sprint Cup.",
